                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MODERATE FLOODING POSSIBLE AT THARGOMINDAH OVER WEEKEND</p>
<p>MINOR FLOODING EASING AT QUILPIE</p>

				<p/>
				<p>In the upper Bulloo River catchment, minor flooding is easing at Quilpie after a moderate flood peak early Monday morning. The flood peak is now arriving at Autumnvale and will approach Thargomindah over the weekend and into early next week. Minor flooding is possible at Thargomindah from about Friday and moderate flooding is possible over the weekend.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
                <element type="severity">Moderate</element>
